{"symbol":"AMANAYA","yahoo":"AMANAYA.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Amanaya Ventures Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Other Precious Metals & Mining","website":"https://www.amanaya.in","about":"Amanaya Ventures Limited engages in the buying and selling of physical gold and silver bars in India. It operates in two segments, Trading of Commodities and Securities; and Corporate Advisory Services. The company supplies 24K Gold and Silver bars under the Aurel Forever Yours! brand for wholesalers, traders, jewellers, bullion desks, and financial entities. It sells its products through Aurel Bullion App, a physical bullion trading platform offering live rates and pricing; aureljewels.com, a direct-to-consumer e-commerce destination for physical bullion and jewellery; and Aurel Gold Purchase Plan and Aurel Silver Purchase Plan. The company also provides business advisory services; and trades in jewellery and securities. Amanaya Ventures Limited was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Amritsar, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:07:42+00:00","quote":{"price":18.0,"prevClose":19.16,"marketCap":6.73,"high52":22.8,"low52":12.0,"pe":31.58,"bookValue":14.78,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":3.92,"shares":0.3739,"insiders":56.41,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-03-09","2023-03-10","2023-03-13","2023-03-14","2023-03-15","2023-03-16","2023-03-17","2023-03-20","2023-03-21","2023-03-22","2023-03-23","2023-03-24","2023-03-27","2023-03-28","2023-03-29","2023-03-31","2023-04-03","2023-04-05","2023-04-06","2023-04-10","2023-04-11","2023-04-12","2023-04-13","2023-04-17","2023-04-18","2023-04-19","2023-04-20","2023-04-21","2023-04-24","2023-04-25","2023-04-26","2023-04-27","2023-04-28","2023-05-02","2023-05-03","2023-05-04","2023-05-05","2023-05-08","2023-05-09","2023-05-10","2023-05-11","2023-05-12","2023-05-15","2023-05-16","2023-05-17","2023-05-18","2023-05-19","2023-05-22","2023-05-23","2023-05-24","2023-05-25","2023-05-26","2023-05-29","2023-05-30","2023-05-31","20